usiness_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Beer, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants, Wine & Spirits","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Nightlife, Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Nightlife","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"SeKVdPJEO2NK5Gcc4QPpjw","review_id":"iTUNsy8w21wee53kdAfg2A","date":"2011-03-10T01:58:19","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9303236603736877,"text_excerpt":"I adore this place! We came in after a day of shopping in the Quarter, during Happy Hour. Apparently they had just opened that week. We were pleasantly surprised. The staff was beyond polite and attentive plus the restaurant was immaculately clean! We just shared an appetizer, salad and a few rounds of drinks. The quality and display of both the food and drinks were exceptional and the prices were really good as well. They have a little of something for everyone! Its a great spot off the super busy French Quarter routes to have a nice quiet drink, but busy enough to get some fun people watching in! And... as embarassed as I am to admit, I had refrain from licking the plate after we finish..."},{"business_id":"SeKVdPJEO2NK5Gcc4QPpjw","review_id":"i3lXLUllnnnsSzOtoPdfRA","date":"2019-08-08T22:06:56","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9253584146499634,"text_excerpt":"We had just finished our tour & just stumbled upon this place by chance. Their main entrance is through the hotel doors & after walking in we realized the way we came in was not the entrance. It took us a while to get seated, probably for that reason. It was not crowded at all with a very nice interior, spacious layout & lots of glass windows. I went with the stuffed Po Boy with shrimp & the bf got their 2 course special with the onion soup & andouille bolognese. The sandwich was stuffed alright, could barely get my mouth around it. Took the vegetables out to make it a little thinner. The perfect amount of batter on the shrimp with a spicy aioli, just ended up just eating the shrimp by it..."},{"business_id":"SeKVdPJEO2NK5Gcc4QPpjw","review_id":"6ekVURGUMr3q_O4uZCF9VA","date":"2011-07-29T23:49:56","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.920219898223877,"text_excerpt":"I had just arrived in New Orleans and was looking for some good lunch fare. My husband, cousin, and I were delighted to read the reviews on Bistreaux and decided to give it a try. Let me start off by saying that there was quite a mix-up. When we walked in the waiter only gave us 2 menus, but I offered to \"share\" with my cousin. I guess I should have let him bring me another menu because he thought I was sharing a meal with my cousin. He took our order and didn't even look at me, but I shouted what I wanted as he walked away and he repeated it to me. I had been up since 4 am and was absolutely starving so you can imagine my disappointment when the waiter came out and my meal was not there...."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"SeKVdPJEO2NK5Gcc4QPpjw","photo_id":"iFNlArzzP0V8LtGtKOg6EQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/iFNlArzzP0V8LtGtKOg6EQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8898918628692627},{"business_id":"SeKVdPJEO2NK5Gcc4QPpjw","photo_id":"012eYNsSYUhNvjC-d3zmYg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/012eYNsSYUhNvjC-d3zmYg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8842547535896301},{"business_id":"SeKVdPJEO2NK5Gcc4QPpjw","photo_id":"dTD1qew8T_HqSW2ZDqrJdg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/dTD1qew8T_HqSW2ZDqrJdg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8610438108444214},{"business_id":"SeKVdPJEO2NK5Gcc4QPpjw","photo_id":"_p2X1GBZjrXMaa0_CdNu-g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/_p2X1GBZjrXMaa0_CdNu-g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8298263549804688},{"business_id":"SeKVdPJEO2NK5Gcc4QPpjw","photo_id":"opU_dst0w-3XZDJ7ALQ3MQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/opU_dst0w-3XZDJ7ALQ3MQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7196550965309143}]},"notebook_case":null}
